From 75324d76b517ff729bdcd604d70643ddfbdb7bc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik <ritvik2014@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:06:54 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 40/40] screen recording: r in the screenshot UI records the
 selection; layer-rule hide-from-capture

r hands the selection (or the output) to ~/.config/niri/scripts/record.sh.
hide-from-capture leaves a layer surface out of screencasts and screenshots
with nothing in its place: the island's recording bar is on the monitor,
never in the video.
