 ```
 
+#### `hide-from-capture`
+
+Leave the surface out of every capture: screencasts, screenshots and screencopy (wf-recorder, grim).
+Unlike `block-out-from`, nothing is drawn in its place, so a control meant only for whoever sits at the screen (a recording's stop button) is simply not in the video.
+
+```kdl
+layer-rule {
+    match namespace="^lumen-private$"
+
+    hide-from-capture true
+}
+```
+
 #### `opacity`
 
 Set the opacity of the surface.
